//                           an area, if the card was never opened) + boss intro, then the VS intro
//   ui.js openCard          area-enter the first time an open area's card opens (also right after the unlock)
//   ui.show (wrapped here)  leaving the result screen: after-tutorial, boss-beaten (before the map unlock), finale
// Each scene plays once per save (save.story.seen); the menu's STORY button replays the seen ones.
// Flags: ?story=<id> preview (&storybeat=N jumps, &storyhold freezes the typewriter/drift), ?nostory disables.
